Mage sight is a sorcery spell that enhances the caster's vision through
a combination of magical effects. It provides a direct bonus to vision
and can passively grant up to five additional vision buffs: infravision,
detect invisible, true sight, detect magic, and sense life.

Each passive is rolled independently based on the caster's skill in that
spell. Higher skill means a better chance of each passive being included.
The passives share the duration of the primary spell -- when mage sight
expires or is dispelled, all of its passives are removed with it.

Mage sight can be cast on yourself, on another character, or with no
target to buff your entire group at once. It can also be found on
scrolls and potions.

See also: INFRAVISION, DETECT INVISIBILITY, TRUE SIGHT, DETECT MAGIC,
          SENSE LIFE
